# Umění listing

`/umeni` uses `Sections/umeni.twig`. Distinct from deník (journal) and rituály (ceremonial chapters).

## Layout

- Greige page ground; white header wash
- Photo-forward gallery wall: featured first piece large, then asymmetric wide/narrow spans on a 12-col grid
- Print shadows + light tilts; native aspect ratios; captions under photos (title + year; summary only on featured)
- Scroll reveal via `data-reveal` + `.is-in` (scoped with other section pages; respects reduced motion)
